          "description": "Completed the truncated component. Implemented the mandatory Veo API key selection flow, including the billing documentation link and the use of window.aistudio helper functions. Implemented the asynchronous video generation workflow with polling via ai.operations.getVideosOperation as required by Gemini 3.1 standards.",
          "diffs": [
